        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present Apartment 16, Block A, Smithfield Market, a superb three-bedroom apartment ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development in the heart of Dublin City Centre.\n\nSituated on the fourth floor, this spacious apartment extends to c. 90 sqm and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, owner-occupiers and investors alike. The property is accessed via Block A, where residents benefit from a concierge service, lift access and an intercom system.\n\nUpon entering, the welcoming hallway provides access to a large storage room, ideal for additional household storage. The accommodation continues to a single bedroom with built-in wardrobes, a generous double bedroom also benefiting from built-in wardrobes and a private balcony, and a family bathroom. The impressive master bedroom features built-in wardrobes, a private ensuite and access to a balcony. This balcony also provides direct access into the living room, creating an excellent connection between the bedroom and main living space. The bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and living room offers an ideal area for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nFurther benefits include electric heating throughout, double-glazed windows, a BER rating of B and one designated underground car parking space.\n\nSmithfield Market enjoys an excellent and highly convenient location within easy reach of Dublin City Centre and a host of amenities. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the Luas Red Line, Dublin Bus routes and numerous cycling and walking routes all providing easy access throughout the city. A fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops, supermarkets and leisure facilities are all available within close proximity, while the nearby Smithfield Square, Four Courts, The Liberties and Stoneybatter provide an abundance of local amenities. The property is also ideally positioned for access to the IFSC, Docklands, Trinity College Dublin, TU Dublin and the city's major employment hubs. The M50 motorway and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible via the city's main road networks.\n\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0861985247 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing or register your interest.\n\nAdditional Features\n• C. 90 sqm\n• BER B\n• Built 2004\n• Superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment\n• Spacious fourth-floor apartment\n• Concierge service in Block A\n• Lift access\n• Three bedrooms\n• Built-in wardrobes in all bedrooms\n• Ensuite off master bedroom\n• Private balconies\n• Balcony access from master bedroom and living room\n• Open-plan kitchen and living room\n• Large storage room off entrance hallway\n• Family bathroom\n• Electric heating throughout\n• Double glazing throughout\n• Intercom system\n• Designated underground car parking space\n• Management fees 5160 per annum\n• Highly sought-after Dublin City Centre location\n• Excellent public transport links\n• Close to Luas Red Line\n• Walking distance to a host of city-centre amenities\n• Easy access to IFSC, Docklands, Trinity College and TU Dublin\n• Excellent investment opportunity\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and owner-occupiers"
      },
